Package: pxfetch
Title: Query PXWeb Statistical APIs
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Emil", "Malta", , "emilmalta89@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: A general-purpose client for PXWeb statistical APIs. Supports
    both v1 (POST/JSON) and v2 (GET/query parameters) API variants. Intended
    for use with any statistics office running PXWeb, not specific to any
    single organisation.
